<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have arrested an alleged Jalisco New Generation Cartel leader in Zapopan and captured a cartel cell with DEA intelligence, while police helicopters opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7-year-old American girl. A mayor who had been abducted was recovered alive after hours of captivity. Rural villagers report that cartels now dominate communities beyond urban areas, extending control to the countryside. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYXhEUmc1OTQzZmZqSU1adTk3UzFDSXBwLXQ0LVJTUkthMlpBQi0yNE40V1hLR0JuNG4wanpOZlIzTlBPMjZlN3lYTkVBbzRyQmVEOVJkcWtvWElJRHJfNE1vanRDcVFnUFlZcjJha0huX2J5clZmZU9HNTdvT2k3VmdWcmZyNHF2MUpSNloyeF9tdUxoOTlqb1pjbW1TSmdVRk1Kbnk5dlBpak96dF9WUGdtcHUtNlpTUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOQkZDWkU2MFBSQ09IcWp0bmY3akRNSzROVEREQnVRTmdBblV5alFxZEVfZ0dXSkNnNmtCWXJTS1ZDVzlPSlRyRzJZTWgyX0tYaFAzblpUcUdDM3dSQjdNdkxGRGhrekc3bEtXQjJTTWpndFpJaXlZNUhlUzE3VU5GSnFHQjUwT215ei12Z1prd3UwTVItdzhaNTkyS0hpRVRzWGxmYWRGTkhFTFo4NmU2bG5UVmx5NldSeV9QUXlRVWxlQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPX1VmS1NXVnB6cnlMRmRRM1dubDY3eGM0Q2stbWlSSVN4dUl0cGNMblQ0ZlU0cVVVUUluSGRubkcyYlFkTTV1TUx3VURtYjZhV2pKa1NXdlUxYTNqa3c1amJ4V1BwLUgzNE84cms0WmtId1RwNVVCX1JQS3U1d2J0XzlOU0hmS01lNVNXZ1NhV1ZmMF9sVHdGSVVxVTd4TmM4RTREMzcxYW85WVZIcVhkVnpSMENZOEhCbW44TW55Uk9kbktBd0xVaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WOAI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: